# MAGIC ## E. Conclusion
# MAGIC
# MAGIC - A Databricks project is made of **code**, **resources**, and an **execution environment**.
# MAGIC - The CI/CD journey promotes a project across **development, staging, and production**, driven by version control, with per-environment configuration.
# MAGIC - The UI, REST API/SDK, and Terraform can each orchestrate deployment, but each has real drawbacks for data engineering CI/CD.
# MAGIC - **Declarative Automation Bundles (DABs)** co-version code and configuration in YAML and deploy to multiple environments easily.
